    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR2b007a-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:15:30.319+09:00">所以，除非出现极端情况，比如天子是桀纣那样的暴君，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:15:36.346+09:00">而诸侯中正好又有商汤、武王那样的仁人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:15:43.319+09:00">天下都归心于商汤文武，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:15:53.484+09:00">上天也授命他们，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:16:07.894+09:00">否则，君臣之分当伏节守死而已。</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
